# Cursor Rules
- Always read `docs/MASTER_CONTEXT.md` first.
- Recreate / operate from `docs/RUNBOOK.md`.
- Log sessions in `docs/PROGRESS.md`. App facts in `docs/settings/`.
- GitHub: https://github.com/ixamal/ix_bangers — docs + exported plans. Never commit audio, stems, NML, TSI, XML libraries, or master.db.
- Git authorship: David alone. No `Co-authored-by: Cursor`, `Co-authored-by: Codex`, `Made-with: Cursor`, or any agent trailer. We vibe-code in Cursor and Codex only.
- Bangers stays in **dry mode** until David says commit. Close Rekordbox before any `rb_*` write.
- Do not reorganize `~/Music/stems_audio` or `~/Music/Music/Media.localized` without a plan in `plans/`.
- Mixer = https://github.com/ixamal/blackhole. Stem CLI = https://github.com/ixamal/stems. Remaps = https://github.com/ixamal/music_migration.

# Rig
- Machine: David / Mac (Apple Silicon), host `ix`
- MCP: bangersss-mcp via `.cursor/mcp.json` (Homebrew Node)
- Traktor Pro 4.5.1, Rekordbox 7, Apple Music, stems tree on disk

# Phases
1. MCP loads. Dry scan of a tiny folder.
2. Rekordbox read-only connect.
3. Written plan before any library execute.

# Journal
- Narrative → docs/PROGRESS.md; architecture → docs/MASTER_CONTEXT.md; how-to → docs/RUNBOOK.md.
